<font size="64">- There are 3 people, and 2 beggars. - Mister, get back here.</font>

2148
00:51:23,590 --> 00:51:25,690
<font size="64">Just order the doenjang sulbap then.</font>

2149
00:51:24,690 --> 00:51:26,350
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Doenjang sulbap, 6 dollars)</font>

2150
00:51:25,690 --> 00:51:27,360
<font size="64">We should just share the doenjang sulbap.</font>

2151
00:51:26,350 --> 00:51:30,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They still pick doenjang sulbap, which is Seok Sam's favorite.)</font>

2152
00:51:27,360 --> 00:51:28,420
<font size="64">- Sure. - That's not bad.</font>

2153
00:51:28,520 --> 00:51:30,390
<font size="64">- The sulbap is a good choice. - Let's go with that.</font>

2154
00:51:30,390 --> 00:51:32,290
<font size="64">How many people does the doenjang sulbap serve?</font>

2155
00:51:32,290 --> 00:51:33,500
<font size="64">- Probably 1. - It's 1 serving.</font>

2156
00:51:32,860 --> 00:51:33,900
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Employee)</font>

2157
00:51:33,630 --> 00:51:36,030
<font size="64">- Is it only one serving? Come on. - That's...</font>

2158
00:51:36,570 --> 00:51:37,830
<font size="64">Then that won't be enough.</font>

2159
00:51:38,030 --> 00:51:41,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They ignore Seok Jin and try to order the 6-dollar doenjang sulbap.)</font>

2160
00:51:38,170 --> 00:51:40,070
<font size="64">- The limit is 50 dollars. - Yes, 50 dollars.</font>

2161
00:51:41,200 --> 00:51:43,340
<font size="64">- Fifty dollars, right? - Transaction complete.</font>

2162
00:51:42,340 --> 00:51:44,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Payment successful)</font>

2163
00:51:43,340 --> 00:51:44,440
<font size="64">- There. - It was 50 dollars.</font>

2164
00:51:44,440 --> 00:51:46,440
<font size="64">- That's better than most. Good job. - I made a good choice.</font>

2165
00:51:44,740 --> 00:51:48,610
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They paid 50 dollars for the 3-person combo and sulbap.)</font>

2166
00:51:46,580 --> 00:51:48,580
<font size="64">- We'll set the table over here. - Right.</font>

2167
00:51:48,580 --> 00:51:50,010
<font size="64">You can set the table for the meat right here.</font>

2168
00:51:50,280 --> 00:51:52,010
<font size="64">- Thank you. - That looks good.</font>

2169
00:51:50,380 --> 00:51:52,110
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The meat is served first.)</font>

2170
00:51:52,010 --> 00:51:53,850
<font size="64">- That looks good. - No way.</font>

2171
00:51:52,810 --> 00:51:56,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The 3-person combo that's enough for 3 people)</font>

2172
00:51:54,180 --> 00:51:55,780
<font size="64">- Check this out. - That's quality meat.</font>

2173
00:51:55,780 --> 00:51:57,620
<font size="64">Check this out. This comes with...</font>

2174
00:51:56,420 --> 00:51:59,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Satisfied)</font>

2175
00:51:57,620 --> 00:51:59,890
<font size="64">- a lot of side dishes. - No way.</font>

2176
00:52:00,060 --> 00:52:01,190
<font size="64">Seok Jin, let's fire ours up too.</font>

2177
00:52:01,820 --> 00:52:03,590
<font size="64">Yes, let's do that. You never know.</font>

2178
00:52:03,590 --> 00:52:05,430
<font size="64">Why are you firing it up? What for?</font>

2179
00:52:05,530 --> 00:52:06,530
<font size="64">Bean sprouts!</font>

2180
00:52:06,530 --> 00:52:07,660
<font size="64">- Sure. - Bean sprouts? Sure thing.</font>

2181
00:52:07,660 --> 00:52:09,870
<font size="64">- Look here, Mr. Kim. - What is it, Mr. Jee?</font>

2182
00:52:09,970 --> 00:52:12,430
<font size="64">- Aren't we in the same shoes? - How so?</font>

2183
00:52:12,600 --> 00:52:14,700
<font size="64">If that were the case, I'd be wearing that outfit too.</font>

2184
00:52:12,700 --> 00:52:14,870
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's right.)</font>

2185
00:52:15,000 --> 00:52:17,740
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Their outfits show the difference in their status.)</font>

2186
00:52:15,040 --> 00:52:16,840
<font size="64">- What? - This is a fashion statement.</font>

2187
00:52:16,840 --> 00:52:19,570
<font size="64">- We wore this to be stylish. - How are we the same...</font>

2188
00:52:19,570 --> 00:52:20,640
<font size="64">when you're dressed as beggars?</font>

2189
00:52:20,640 --> 00:52:21,880
<font size="64">- Call me Pumba. - Hey...</font>

2190
00:52:22,110 --> 00:52:23,850
<font size="64">- I'm not a beggar. - Pumba?</font>

2191
00:52:24,080 --> 00:52:25,150
<font size="64">Your Grace.</font>

2192
00:52:25,150 --> 00:52:27,580
<font size="64">- That sound is incredible. - Can't we have one of them?</font>

2193
00:52:27,580 --> 00:52:29,820
<font size="64">- I won't ask for more. - Perfect timing.</font>

2194
00:52:27,750 --> 00:52:31,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Beggar Ha starts begging.)</font>

2195
00:52:29,820 --> 00:52:31,050
<font size="64">What do you mean you won't ask for more?</font>

2196
00:52:32,850 --> 00:52:33,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Suddenly)</font>

2197
00:52:33,860 --> 00:52:36,220
<font size="64">- Seriously? - Hey, mister!</font>

2198
00:52:36,390 --> 00:52:37,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Just one piece)</font>

2199
00:52:36,390 --> 00:52:37,460
<font size="64">Just the smaller piece.</font>

2200
00:52:37,690 --> 00:52:39,690
<font size="64">- No way. - Are you kidding me?</font>

2201
00:52:39,690 --> 00:52:41,160
<font size="64">We'll cook it on just one of the grills.</font>

2202
00:52:41,160 --> 00:52:42,900
<font size="64">- There's more than enough. - Why waste this grill?</font>

2203
00:52:42,900 --> 00:52:44,030
<font size="64">We'll think about giving you some later.</font>

2204
00:52:44,030 --> 00:52:45,730
<font size="64">Turn it off then. Why are you wasting gas?</font>

2205
00:52:45,730 --> 00:52:47,240
<font size="64">I'll grill the kimchi for you.</font>

2206
00:52:46,500 --> 00:52:48,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He volunteers to grill the kimchi.)</font>

2207
00:52:47,240 --> 00:52:48,570
<font size="64">- Okay, hurry up with that. - Hold on.</font>

2208
00:52:48,840 --> 00:52:49,910
<font size="64">If you give us some pork fat...</font>

2209
00:52:48,940 --> 00:52:50,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Casually)</font>

2210
00:52:49,910 --> 00:52:52,010
<font size="64">You know you can't cook with that on this grill.</font>

2211
00:52:52,010 --> 00:52:53,440
<font size="64">- We'll put on a show for you. - We'll cook it on...</font>

2212
00:52:53,580 --> 00:52:54,740
<font size="64">- just one of the grills. - How about some whistling?</font>

2213
00:52:54,740 --> 00:52:56,710
<font size="64">Shouldn't you know that since you run a barbecue place?</font>

2214
00:52:57,810 --> 00:53:00,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A sudden whistling performance)</font>

2215
00:53:04,620 --> 00:53:06,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Embarrassed)</font>

2216
00:53:06,760 --> 00:53:09,420
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Chuckling)</font>

2217
00:53:07,860 --> 00:53:09,220
<font size="64">- Why... - Do you know why we did that?</font>

2218
00:53:09,520 --> 00:53:11,090
<font size="64">We're thinking about releasing an album.</font>

2219
00:53:11,560 --> 00:53:12,590
<font size="64">The Whistling Boys.</font>

2220
00:53:11,790 --> 00:53:14,160
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Whistling Boys, the beggar duo)</font>

2221
00:53:12,590 --> 00:53:14,130
<font size="64">We're thinking about releasing an album as the Whistling Boys.</font>

2222
00:53:14,360 --> 00:53:15,530
<font size="64">Can you do a song for us?</font>

2223
00:53:15,530 --> 00:53:17,200
<font size="64">- Of course. - Any requests?</font>

2224
00:53:16,500 --> 00:53:18,470
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Of course we can do it.)</font>

2225
00:53:18,400 --> 00:53:20,770
<font size="64">- How about "One Man?" - Okay, go.</font>

2226
00:53:20,940 --> 00:53:23,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">("One Man" by Whistling Boys, original song by Kim Jong Kook)</font>

2227
00:53:23,440 --> 00:53:25,170
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The original singer is pleased.)</font>

2228
00:53:24,040 --> 00:53:25,170
<font size="64">They're pretty good.</font>

2229
00:53:25,340 --> 00:53:27,910
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A pretty pleasant begging show)</font>

2230
00:53:25,940 --> 00:53:27,340
<font size="64">They're good.</font>

2231
00:53:27,740 --> 00:53:28,840
<font size="64">They're good.</font>

2232
00:53:29,710 --> 00:53:31,380
<font size="64">If only this were actually useful.</font>

2233
00:53:32,910 --> 00:53:35,620
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The beggars even add harmony.)</font>

2234
00:53:35,650 --> 00:53:37,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Laughing)</font>

2235
00:53:38,190 --> 00:53:42,660
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(An angelic melody pours from their puckered lips.)</font>

2236
00:53:42,790 --> 00:53:45,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Give us a piece.)</font>

2237
00:53:45,690 --> 00:53:47,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Impressed)</font>

2238
00:53:47,400 --> 00:53:48,630
<font size="64">- We should thank them. - No way. That...</font>

2239
00:53:48,630 --> 00:53:51,200
<font size="64">- Thank you. Hold on. - Thank you. Ready, go.</font>

2240
00:53:52,230 --> 00:53:54,070
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Even the "thank you" is perfect.)</font>

2241
00:53:54,270 --> 00:53:56,100
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Satisfied)</font>

2242
00:53:55,400 --> 00:53:57,110
<font size="64">You should give us something for that.</font>

2243
00:53:57,110 --> 00:53:59,010
<font size="64">- There's more than enough. - We'll grill this first.</font>

2244
00:53:59,010 --> 00:54:00,940
<font size="64">- Seriously, mister. - We even performed for you.</font>

2245
00:54:00,940 --> 00:54:03,550
<font size="64">- That cost us our jaws. - We got you. Just be patient.</font>

2246
00:54:03,550 --> 00:54:05,580
<font size="64">The meat isn't ready yet.</font>

2247
00:54:05,580 --> 00:54:07,550
<font size="64">Why do you keep insisting when the meat isn't cooked?</font>

2248
00:54:05,680 --> 00:54:09,180
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They resume performing after hearing they'll get some meat.)</font>

2249
00:54:08,780 --> 00:54:10,150
<font size="64">I'm sorry, but it's annoying now.</font>

2250
00:54:10,750 --> 00:54:12,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hurt)</font>

2251
00:54:12,020 --> 00:54:13,890
<font size="64">Give them some meat and send them on their way.</font>

2252
00:54:14,360 --> 00:54:15,520
<font size="64">Let us have one of the cuts.</font>

2253
00:54:15,520 --> 00:54:16,560
<font size="64">- Hey. - Hey.</font>

2254
00:54:16,560 --> 00:54:18,460
<font size="64">How many pieces do you want each?</font>

2255
00:54:16,630 --> 00:54:18,460
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Pitiful)</font>

2256
00:54:18,460 --> 00:54:20,130
<font size="64">- Three. - Go ahead. Let's hear it.</font>

2257
00:54:20,200 --> 00:54:21,960
<font size="64">- Three. - He wants three pieces.</font>

2258
00:54:20,800 --> 00:54:23,500
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The deal broke down because of their unreasonable demand.)</font>

2259
00:54:22,160 --> 00:54:23,600
<font size="64">Are you kidding me?</font>

2260
00:54:23,670 --> 00:54:26,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The pork belly is cooked.)</font>

2261
00:54:24,100 --> 00:54:26,200
<font size="64">We'll try the meat that's been cooked...</font>

2262
00:54:26,800 --> 00:54:28,440
<font size="64">and see how good it is.</font>

2263
00:54:29,340 --> 00:54:30,740
<font size="64">You're going to eat it?</font>

2264
00:54:31,110 --> 00:54:32,270
<font size="64">- Well... - When the beggars...</font>

2265
00:54:31,970 --> 00:54:35,640
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They start eating without the Whistling Brothers.)</font>

2266
00:54:32,270 --> 00:54:33,410
<font size="64">are left here watching?</font>

2267
00:54:33,410 --> 00:54:35,780
<font size="64">- That's just mean. - Seriously.</font>

2268
00:54:35,910 --> 00:54:38,250
<font size="64">- That's why... - What they're doing is mean.</font>

2269
00:54:38,250 --> 00:54:40,450
<font size="64">- The ssamjang... - Let us have a piece.</font>

2270
00:54:39,210 --> 00:54:40,920
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Exclaiming)</font>

2271
00:54:41,320 --> 00:54:43,020
<font size="64">Hold on. Let us try some first.</font>

2272
00:54:43,250 --> 00:54:44,520
<font size="64">- It's good. - I'll see if it's good.</font>

2273
00:54:45,920 --> 00:54:46,990
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Savoring)</font>

2274
00:54:47,920 --> 00:54:48,920
<font size="64">It's so good.</font>

2275
00:54:48,090 --> 00:54:49,720
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Impressed)</font>

2276
00:54:51,230 --> 00:54:54,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They get a piece for providing entertainment.)</font>

2277
00:54:54,360 --> 00:54:55,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Pulling)</font>

2278
00:54:55,730 --> 00:55:00,040
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The good brothers even share a piece of meat.)</font>

2279
00:54:59,630 --> 00:55:00,700
<font size="64">Thank you.</font>

2280
00:55:00,040 --> 00:55:01,340
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Exclaiming)</font>

2281
00:55:01,100 --> 00:55:02,600
<font size="64">Oh my gosh.</font>

2282
00:55:03,540 --> 00:55:04,940
<font size="64">Oh my gosh.</font>

2283
00:55:03,570 --> 00:55:05,010
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Exclaiming)</font>

2284
00:55:05,040 --> 00:55:08,080
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Automatic whistling)</font>

2285
00:55:10,610 --> 00:55:12,610
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Fumbling)</font>

2286
00:55:13,650 --> 00:55:15,020
<font size="64">Now that I'm eating, I can't do it properly.</font>

2287
00:55:15,280 --> 00:55:17,150
<font size="64">That tasted amazing.</font>

2288
00:55:17,520 --> 00:55:18,590
<font size="64">I'll have some of the doenjang sulbap.</font>

2289
00:55:19,150 --> 00:55:20,190
<font size="64">Sure.</font>

2290
00:55:21,020 --> 00:55:24,760
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Stealing a piece of paradise)</font>

2291
00:55:23,660 --> 00:55:24,760
<font size="64">Can we have the sulbap?</font>

2292
00:55:25,090 --> 00:55:26,130
<font size="64">Here.</font>

2293
00:55:26,800 --> 00:55:28,500
<font size="64">I saw Seok Jin...</font>

2294
00:55:28,960 --> 00:55:31,170
<font size="64">steal a piece of meat just now.</font>

2295
00:55:31,300 --> 00:55:32,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Trying to look away)</font>

2296
00:55:32,100 --> 00:55:33,640
<font size="64">Grand Duke Haha,</font>

2297
00:55:33,870 --> 00:55:35,200
<font size="64">sit with us.</font>

2298
00:55:35,800 --> 00:55:39,670
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The Grand Duke of the Belly strictly rewards and punishes.)</font>

2299
00:55:35,870 --> 00:55:37,270
<font size="64">Have as much as you want.</font>

2300
00:55:37,270 --> 00:55:39,640
<font size="64">Sit with us. Have as much as you want.</font>

2301
00:55:39,940 --> 00:55:43,340
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Beggar Ha leaves his guilty brother behind.)</font>

2302
00:55:40,410 --> 00:55:43,210
<font size="64">I have to address this. Enjoy the sulbap too.</font>

2303
00:55:43,650 --> 00:55:45,080
<font size="64">- What? - Do you want some?</font>

2304
00:55:45,180 --> 00:55:46,250
<font size="64">Stop it. You're done.</font>

2305
00:55:46,950 --> 00:55:49,280
<font size="64">- Hey. - Haha, enjoy.</font>

2306
00:55:49,620 --> 00:55:51,250
<font size="64">- Hey. - I can't believe you.</font>

2307
00:55:51,250 --> 00:55:52,550
<font size="64">- Have you no pride at all? - No.</font>

2308
00:55:52,620 --> 00:55:55,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He takes it out on Haha instead.)</font>

2309
00:55:53,220 --> 00:55:54,260
<font size="64">I can't believe you just joined them.</font>

2310
00:55:55,420 --> 00:55:56,960
<font size="64">- Have as much as you want. - Thank you!</font>

2311
00:55:56,290 --> 00:55:57,830
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Loyal)</font>

2312
00:55:57,760 --> 00:55:59,830
<font size="64">- I warned you, didn't I? - Good job.</font>

2313
00:55:57,990 --> 00:56:01,030
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The lonely Jee-rasoni is left alone as always.)</font>

2314
00:55:59,960 --> 00:56:01,730
<font size="64">I can't believe you caught that.</font>

2315
00:56:01,800 --> 00:56:02,930
<font size="64">Of course I did.</font>

2316
00:56:04,000 --> 00:56:06,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Quietly approaching)</font>

2317
00:56:05,500 --> 00:56:07,400
<font size="64">- It's tasty. - Shall we take a photo?</font>

2318
00:56:08,470 --> 00:56:10,210
<font size="64">- Just like that? - Take one for us.</font>

2319
00:56:10,240 --> 00:56:13,840
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Holding on so he can't steal any meat)</font>

2320
00:56:11,570 --> 00:56:13,270
<font size="64">Take our photo. One...</font>

2321
00:56:13,480 --> 00:56:15,540
<font size="64">We haven't taken a photo in a while.</font>

2322
00:56:15,940 --> 00:56:17,580
<font size="64">- Hair's getting in my mouth. - Let's pose.</font>

2323
00:56:17,580 --> 00:56:19,350
<font size="64">- One, two... - One...</font>

2324
00:56:19,250 --> 00:56:21,080
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A rock-solid defense)</font>

2325
00:56:19,350 --> 00:56:21,150
<font size="64">- Two, three. - Two, three.</font>

2326
00:56:21,350 --> 00:56:22,750
<font size="64">Darn it.</font>

2327
00:56:22,750 --> 00:56:23,750
<font size="64">It came out nice.</font>

2328
00:56:23,750 --> 00:56:25,750
<font size="64">He wanted to take a group photo...</font>

2329
00:56:23,850 --> 00:56:28,590
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He leaves without nothing but memories instead of meat.)</font>

2330
00:56:26,690 --> 00:56:28,920
<font size="64">That's madness. They saw through me.</font>

2331
00:56:29,260 --> 00:56:32,690
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Time to interview the grand duke)</font>

2332
00:56:30,830 --> 00:56:32,290
<font size="64">- Grand Duke of the Belly. - Yes.</font>

2333
00:56:32,290 --> 00:56:34,560
<font size="64">What do you think about the state of your nation?</font>

2334
00:56:34,560 --> 00:56:37,230
<font size="64">The state of my nation? It's...</font>

2335
00:56:37,670 --> 00:56:41,170
<font size="64">There's a loach that's muddying the waters.</font>

2336
00:56:41,270 --> 00:56:45,070
<font size="64">I must drive him out of my nation immediately.</font>

2337
00:56:45,210 --> 00:56:46,910
<font size="64">He must get spat on the face.</font>

2338
00:56:47,210 --> 00:56:51,180
<font size="64">He must be utterly humiliated so he's reminded of his place.</font>

2339
00:56:48,180 --> 00:56:51,610
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He can hear everything.)</font>

2340
00:56:51,480 --> 00:56:55,280
<font size="64">I took him in because I thought he'd end up in a ditch somewhere.</font>

2341
00:56:55,580 --> 00:56:56,950
<font size="64">That beggar...</font>

2342
00:56:57,720 --> 00:56:59,790
<font size="64">He must be thrown out pantless...</font>

2343
00:57:00,050 --> 00:57:03,260
<font size="64">and left to get soaked by the rain.</font>

2344
00:57:04,560 --> 00:57:06,930
<font size="64">Hey, if you think about it,</font>

2345
00:57:06,930 --> 00:57:08,830
<font size="64">Seok Jin did nothing wrong.</font>

2346
00:57:09,630 --> 00:57:12,430
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jee Seok Jin, the whistling beggar)</font>

2347
00:57:09,830 --> 00:57:12,500
<font size="64">- What did I do wrong? - What did he do?</font>

2348
00:57:12,630 --> 00:57:14,940
<font size="64">Who do you think is the outsider?</font>

2349
00:57:15,440 --> 00:57:17,470
<font size="64">I don't think the outsider is among us.</font>

2350
00:57:17,470 --> 00:57:21,640
<font size="64">But Seok Jin wanted to take a group photo earlier.</font>

2351
00:57:22,180 --> 00:57:24,980
<font size="64">He's not the type to want to take photos.</font>

2352
00:57:22,410 --> 00:57:25,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(His sudden behavior is highly suspicious.)</font>

2353
00:57:25,280 --> 00:57:28,750
<font size="64">If that's a hidden mission, Seok Jin's a strong possibility.</font>

2354
00:57:29,120 --> 00:57:32,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(While suspicion is growing within Team North,)</font>

2355
00:57:29,780 --> 00:57:30,850
<font size="64">Then...</font>

2356
00:57:31,190 --> 00:57:32,450
<font size="64">- Breakfast... - It's here.</font>

2357
00:57:32,150 --> 00:57:36,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Team North's food is served.)</font>

2358
00:57:32,450 --> 00:57:33,860
<font size="64">- The bread... - Thank you.</font>

2359
00:57:33,860 --> 00:57:35,090
<font size="64">We get all this?</font>

2360
00:57:36,290 --> 00:57:38,460
<font size="64">- Thanks for the food. - I like this. Outback bread.</font>

2361
00:57:36,560 --> 00:57:39,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Excited)</font>

2362
00:57:38,460 --> 00:57:40,200
<font size="64">- Yes. - Outback Steakhouse.</font>

2363
00:57:39,160 --> 00:57:42,860
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Only a piece of bread can make Food Fighter happy.)</font>

2364
00:57:40,200 --> 00:57:41,230
<font size="64">- Ye Eun. - Yes?</font>

2365
00:57:41,230 --> 00:57:43,670
<font size="64">- You don't dislike any food. - Come on...</font>

2366
00:57:44,200 --> 00:57:46,500
<font size="64">Outback Steakhouse's bread...</font>

2367
00:57:47,470 --> 00:57:48,640
<font size="64">It's so tasty.</font>

2368
00:57:48,440 --> 00:57:49,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Savoring)</font>

2369
00:57:49,570 --> 00:57:51,440
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Applause)</font>

2370
00:57:50,310 --> 00:57:52,870
<font size="64">This is enough for me. How can bread be so...</font>

2371
00:57:52,270 --> 00:57:55,110
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Everyone is enjoying it.)</font>

2372
00:57:52,970 --> 00:57:54,810
<font size="64">You baked them so well.</font>

2373
00:57:55,340 --> 00:57:58,480
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The flying fish roe pasta is served.)</font>

2374
00:57:56,710 --> 00:57:58,080
<font size="64">- It's so pretty. - It looks amazing.</font>

2375
00:57:58,080 --> 00:58:00,220
<font size="64">- Grand Duke, take some first. - Okay.</font>

2376
00:58:00,220 --> 00:58:02,380
<font size="64">- Serve yourself first. - Serve yourself.</font>

2377
00:58:02,380 --> 00:58:06,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The youngest one is not used to the class system.)</font>

2378
00:58:02,680 --> 00:58:04,350
<font size="64">There's a strict hierarchy.</font>

2379
00:58:04,950 --> 00:58:06,050
<font size="64">Gosh, it's good.</font>

2380
00:58:06,150 --> 00:58:07,490
<font size="64">- The pasta... - The bread is so good.</font>

2381
00:58:06,420 --> 00:58:08,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Twirling)</font>

2382
00:58:07,490 --> 00:58:08,760
<font size="64">It's delicious.</font>

2383
00:58:08,660 --> 00:58:11,030
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He gives it to Jae Seok first.)</font>

2384
00:58:08,960 --> 00:58:10,930
<font size="64">- Serve yourself first. - Why...</font>

2385
00:58:10,930 --> 00:58:12,390
<font size="64">- You... - Grand Duke.</font>

2386
00:58:11,730 --> 00:58:14,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Thank you.)</font>

2387
00:58:12,390 --> 00:58:13,860
<font size="64">Grand Duke.</font>

2388
00:58:13,960 --> 00:58:16,200
<font size="64">- This is too little. - That's too little.</font>

2389
00:58:16,200 --> 00:58:17,570
<font size="64">You gave me so little.</font>

2390
00:58:17,870 --> 00:58:20,970
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A small serving to show his big heart)</font>

2391
00:58:23,370 --> 00:58:25,570
<font size="64">It tastes good.</font>

2392
00:58:25,570 --> 00:58:27,810
<font size="64">He fills another plate.</font>

2393
00:58:25,670 --> 00:58:27,980
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He puts more pasta on another plate.)</font>

2394
00:58:27,810 --> 00:58:29,980
<font size="64">You can have that. You eat that.</font>

2395
00:58:30,580 --> 00:58:33,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Delivered to Ji Eun)</font>

2396
00:58:31,980 --> 00:58:33,850
<font size="64">- I can take my time. - What's going on?</font>

2397
00:58:35,020 --> 00:58:37,250
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(It wasn't for me?)</font>

2398
00:58:38,850 --> 00:58:39,890
<font size="64">- You... - You have this.</font>

2399
00:58:39,890 --> 00:58:41,320
<font size="64">You served another nation's beggar first?</font>

2400
00:58:41,820 --> 00:58:44,230
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Laughing)</font>

2401
00:58:43,460 --> 00:58:45,090
<font size="64">- I... - You can eat this.</font>

2402
00:58:45,560 --> 00:58:46,560
<font size="64">Are you okay?</font>

2403
00:58:46,560 --> 00:58:48,560
<font size="64">I'm going in order of age.</font>

2404
00:58:48,560 --> 00:58:50,470
<font size="64">- You seem to be shocked. - Yes.</font>

2405
00:58:50,530 --> 00:58:53,270
<font size="64">I thought he was going to serve me next.</font>

2406
00:58:53,270 --> 00:58:54,340
<font size="64">You eat this.</font>

2407
00:58:54,340 --> 00:58:55,470
<font size="64">- No, I... - No, go ahead.</font>

2408
00:58:55,470 --> 00:58:56,570
<font size="64">- That's so funny. - You eat it.</font>

2409
00:58:56,570 --> 00:58:58,370
<font size="64">- Can I have a little more? - Ye Eun.</font>

2410
00:58:56,910 --> 00:58:58,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The point)</font>

2411
00:58:58,370 --> 00:59:00,340
<font size="64">- Give me a little more. - Say that on a blind date?</font>

2412
00:59:00,340 --> 00:59:02,380
<font size="64">- It's really annoying. - I thought it was mine.</font>

2413
00:59:00,510 --> 00:59:04,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The fallen grand duchess can't resist her appetite.)</font>

2414
00:59:03,010 --> 00:59:05,080
<font size="64">You blurted it out.</font>

2415
00:59:06,480 --> 00:59:07,750
<font size="64">Some fish roe too, please.</font>

2416
00:59:10,120 --> 00:59:11,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Adding fish roe)</font>

2417
00:59:12,720 --> 00:59:13,790
<font size="64">And some veg.</font>

2418
00:59:13,890 --> 00:59:15,490
<font size="64">Aren't you on a diet?</font>

2419
00:59:15,590 --> 00:59:17,590
<font size="64">No, I can eat today. Thank you.</font>

2420
00:59:15,590 --> 00:59:17,490
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Cheat day)</font>

2421
00:59:17,590 --> 00:59:20,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The most generous portion)</font>

2422
00:59:17,590 --> 00:59:19,830
<font size="64">You ordered a steak earlier.</font>

2423
00:59:19,830 --> 00:59:21,760
<font size="64">- You can eat the rest. - Yes.</font>

2424
00:59:21,760 --> 00:59:23,900
<font size="64">- Grand Duke. Eat. - Eat the rest.</font>

2425
00:59:21,830 --> 00:59:26,130
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The grand duke eats after serving his people.)</font>

2426
00:59:24,200 --> 00:59:25,200
<font size="64">It's tasty.</font>

2427
00:59:28,670 --> 00:59:29,670
<font size="64">It's so good.</font>

2428
00:59:31,970 --> 00:59:34,810
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Eating)</font>

2429
00:59:31,970 --> 00:59:34,210
<font size="64">- It's delicious. - It's fresh.</font>

2430
00:59:34,280 --> 00:59:36,740
<font size="64">Why did you give the beggar so much food?</font>

2431
00:59:37,580 --> 00:59:39,150
<font size="64">- She got a lot. - Why...</font>

2432
00:59:39,750 --> 00:59:41,750
<font size="64">I was getting food for her,</font>

2433
00:59:41,750 --> 00:59:44,250
<font size="64">and I kept hearing a hallucination from my right.</font>

2434
00:59:44,690 --> 00:59:46,250
<font size="64">- "I want more." - Give me a little more.</font>

2435
00:59:46,250 --> 00:59:48,720
<font size="64">- She said that? - "Some fish roe too."</font>

2436
00:59:48,460 --> 00:59:52,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(A hallucination with very specific demands)</font>

2437
00:59:48,790 --> 00:59:50,960
<font size="64">- Some fish roe too, please. - "And some veg."</font>

2438
00:59:50,960 --> 00:59:52,290
<font size="64">- And some veg. - It looks like...</font>

2439
00:59:52,290 --> 00:59:53,930
<font size="64">she enjoys eating.</font>

2440
00:59:54,360 --> 00:59:55,960
<font size="64">She has a hearty appetite.</font>

2441
00:59:55,400 --> 00:59:59,370
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Everyone filled their stomachs.)</font>

2442
00:59:56,360 --> 00:59:57,970
<font size="64">Ji Eun eats so well.</font>

2443
00:59:58,330 --> 00:59:59,470
<font size="64">She was really hungry.</font>

2444
00:59:59,470 --> 01:00:02,440
<font size="64">What could this be? How fun will this game be?</font>

2445
01:00:00,170 --> 01:00:03,240
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The two families have returned from their meal out.)</font>

2446
01:00:02,440 --> 01:00:03,670
<font size="64">- What's this? - Isn't it that game?</font>

2447
01:00:03,670 --> 01:00:05,370
<font size="64">- What I did before. - What you did.</font>

2448
01:00:05,370 --> 01:00:07,810
<font size="64">- Oh... - Oh, dear. This looks...</font>

2449
01:00:05,710 --> 01:00:08,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The physical game set looks familiar somehow.)</font>

2450
01:00:08,340 --> 01:00:10,450
<font size="64">- No way. - Seok Jin fell backward.</font>

2451
01:00:10,450 --> 01:00:12,480
<font size="64">Wasn't he dressed like this that time too?</font>

2452
01:00:13,110 --> 01:00:14,480
<font size="64">I was a beggar then too.</font>

2453
01:00:13,350 --> 01:00:14,850
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Right)</font>

2454
01:00:14,920 --> 01:00:17,120
<font size="64">- Good luck. - Good luck.</font>

2455
01:00:14,980 --> 01:00:17,190
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The Joseon gambler episode from summer 3 years ago)</font>

2456
01:00:19,490 --> 01:00:23,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam hit himself in the back of the head.)</font>

2457
01:00:23,190 --> 01:00:24,190
<font size="64">It is that same game.</font>

2458
01:00:24,190 --> 01:00:26,390
<font size="64">I was actually scared that time.</font>

2459
01:00:26,560 --> 01:00:29,600
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam's worried already.)</font>

2460
01:00:27,430 --> 01:00:29,960
<font size="64">- It's fine if you're clueless. - This game...</font>

2461
01:00:30,200 --> 01:00:31,200
<font size="64">That's true.</font>

2462
01:00:30,800 --> 01:00:33,270
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ji Eun enters.)</font>

2463
01:00:32,770 --> 01:00:33,770
<font size="64">That was so funny.</font>

2464
01:00:33,770 --> 01:00:36,370
<font size="64">You changed clothes. The funny makeup is gone too.</font>

2465
01:00:36,440 --> 01:00:37,640
<font size="64">That is what's happening.</font>

2466
01:00:37,640 --> 01:00:40,070
<font size="64">- That's it. - You didn't take it off.</font>

2467
01:00:40,910 --> 01:00:44,880
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ji Eun removed her beggar makeup, following the instructions.)</font>

2468
01:00:40,910 --> 01:00:42,640
<font size="64">You can't fall on purpose.</font>

2469
01:00:42,640 --> 01:00:44,650
<font size="64">- You look different. - Weren't we supposed to clean up?</font>

2470
01:00:44,650 --> 01:00:45,950
<font size="64">- You're a guest. - We kept it on.</font>

2471
01:00:44,950 --> 01:00:48,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They heard it too, but they were too lazy to remove their makeup.)</font>

2472
01:00:45,950 --> 01:00:47,220
<font size="64">- Sit down. - Come here, beggar.</font>

2473
01:00:47,220 --> 01:00:48,220
<font size="64">- Beggar. - Take a seat.</font>

2474
01:00:48,220 --> 01:00:49,220
<font size="64">Weren't we supposed to clean up?</font>

2475
01:00:49,220 --> 01:00:52,790
<font size="64">Ji Eun looks like that actor from "Coffee Prince."</font>

2476
01:00:52,790 --> 01:00:53,890
<font size="64">- What? - Yoon Eun Hye.</font>

2477
01:00:53,890 --> 01:00:55,960
<font size="64">She does look a bit like her.</font>

2478
01:00:55,960 --> 01:00:57,390
<font size="64">Why was I told to take off the beggar makeup?</font>

2479
01:00:56,920 --> 01:00:58,890
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The final mission is revealed.)</font>

2480
01:00:57,390 --> 01:01:00,260
<font size="64">The last mission is called Fly, Grand Duke, Fly.</font>

2481
01:01:00,260 --> 01:01:03,630
<font size="64">You're playing to save your nation and win a hint about the outsiders.</font>

2482
01:01:01,830 --> 01:01:06,700
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(1. Absorb the opposing kingdom. 2. Gain a hint about the outsider.)</font>

2483
01:01:03,630 --> 01:01:05,630
<font size="64">- We need a hint. - We do.</font>

2484
01:01:05,630 --> 01:01:08,640
<font size="64">- One person per team will compete. - Okay.</font>

2485
01:01:08,640 --> 01:01:11,540
<font size="64">You must squat low, holding a bowl full of water.</font>

2486
01:01:11,540 --> 01:01:14,380
<font size="64">You'll hop onto four tiles to reach the other end of the mat...</font>

2487
01:01:14,380 --> 01:01:17,380
<font size="64">and pour whatever water is in your bowl into the bucket.</font>

2488
01:01:17,580 --> 01:01:20,850
<font size="64">Once you're done, you can run back to the start.</font>

2489
01:01:20,880 --> 01:01:23,180
<font size="64">The team that collects the most water...</font>

2490
01:01:23,180 --> 01:01:24,950
<font size="64">- in 100 seconds wins. - Gosh.</font>

2491
01:01:25,220 --> 01:01:26,490
<font size="64">Collected in that bucket?</font>

2492
01:01:26,490 --> 01:01:27,790
<font size="64">How do you hop onto those?</font>

2493
01:01:27,790 --> 01:01:29,660
<font size="64">I have a fear of this game.</font>

2494
01:01:29,660 --> 01:01:32,460
<font size="64">- This game traumatized me. - I'd love to see this work.</font>

2495
01:01:32,460 --> 01:01:34,630
<font size="64">Pick someone to represent your team.</font>

2496
01:01:33,490 --> 01:01:36,000
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(They'll pick the players for Round 1.)</font>

2497
01:01:35,200 --> 01:01:36,460
<font size="64">Seok Jin will represent us.</font>

2498
01:01:36,000 --> 01:01:39,300
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam, who's played this game, will go first.)</font>

2499
01:01:36,460 --> 01:01:38,170
<font size="64">- This game requires a mouth guard. - Right.</font>

2500
01:01:38,170 --> 01:01:39,870
<font size="64">- You can bite your tongue. - Totally.</font>

2501
01:01:39,930 --> 01:01:40,940
<font size="64">Okay.</font>

2502
01:01:40,130 --> 01:01:42,740
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Jae Seok on Team North is his opponent.)</font>

2503
01:01:41,470 --> 01:01:42,970
<font size="64">- Oh, dear. - Let's go.</font>

2504
01:01:42,970 --> 01:01:43,970
<font size="64">Shall I draw a line of snot?</font>

2505
01:01:43,970 --> 01:01:45,810
<font size="64">- Yes. - Would that be better?</font>

2506
01:01:47,210 --> 01:01:51,080
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ji Eun's getting her face retouched voluntarily.)</font>

2507
01:01:48,540 --> 01:01:50,450
<font size="64">Isn't this enough?</font>

2508
01:01:51,280 --> 01:01:52,310
<font size="64">Take a look.</font>

2509
01:01:52,480 --> 01:01:54,720
<font size="64">One person from each team...</font>

2510
01:01:53,050 --> 01:01:57,450
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Ji Eun and Ji Hyo will help them.)</font>

2511
01:01:54,720 --> 01:01:56,820
<font size="64">- will hop along. - Use your core muscles.</font>

2512
01:01:56,820 --> 01:01:57,850
<font size="64">Your core muscles.</font>

2513
01:01:57,850 --> 01:01:59,620
<font size="64">Okay. Ready?</font>

2514
01:01:59,690 --> 01:02:01,090
<font size="64">- He'll do well, I think. - Go.</font>

2515
01:02:01,060 --> 01:02:02,260
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Start)</font>

2516
01:02:03,320 --> 01:02:04,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Yelping)</font>

2517
01:02:04,490 --> 01:02:05,760
<font size="64">- He'll do well, I think. - Good luck.</font>

2518
01:02:06,330 --> 01:02:08,030
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He spilled half the water already.)</font>

2519
01:02:07,260 --> 01:02:08,730
<font size="64">It's fine. It's okay.</font>

2520
01:02:08,730 --> 01:02:09,960
<font size="64">Jump.</font>

2521
01:02:10,200 --> 01:02:11,200
<font size="64">Oh, dear.</font>

2522
01:02:11,330 --> 01:02:13,940
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Seok Sam almost spilled everything.)</font>

2523
01:02:11,570 --> 01:02:14,540
<font size="64">Seok Jin! Why did you drop that?</font>

2524
01:02:14,540 --> 01:02:17,070
<font size="64">The memory from three years ago...</font>

2525
01:02:15,470 --> 01:02:17,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Trauma)</font>

2526
01:02:17,070 --> 01:02:20,340
<font size="64">- I can't help it. - Don't drop the bag.</font>

2527
01:02:18,770 --> 01:02:20,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Refill)</font>

2528
01:02:20,340 --> 01:02:21,380
<font size="64">Here goes.</font>

2529
01:02:21,480 --> 01:02:23,740
<font size="64">- All right! - Good luck!</font>

2530
01:02:23,510 --> 01:02:26,580
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The grasshopper's hopping well?)</font>

2531
01:02:23,740 --> 01:02:26,250
<font size="64">- Here goes. - Good luck!</font>

2532
01:02:28,620 --> 01:02:30,280
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He fails.)</font>

2533
01:02:28,820 --> 01:02:30,120
<font size="64">Oh, dear.</font>

2534
01:02:30,490 --> 01:02:32,520
<font size="64">Oh, dear.</font>

2535
01:02:32,590 --> 01:02:33,960
<font size="64">Hurry.</font>

2536
01:02:36,660 --> 01:02:38,030
