3158
01:17:17,740 --> 01:17:20,140
<font size="64">- I see. A leading question. - That's right.</font>

3159
01:17:18,570 --> 01:17:21,140
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(While the Grand Dukes are planning to sound them out...)</font>

3160
01:17:20,810 --> 01:17:22,880
