3193
01:18:11,660 --> 01:18:12,790
<font size="64">For goodness' sake.</font>

3194
01:18:13,160 --> 01:18:14,630
<font size="64">You're so clueless.</font>

3195
01:18:14,630 --> 01:18:15,960
<font size="64">- Grasshopper did act strange. - I agree with him.</font>

3196
01:18:16,060 --> 01:18:17,800
<font size="64">- You're so clueless. - Jae Seok might be right.</font>

3197
01:18:17,800 --> 01:18:19,070
