3208
01:18:31,850 --> 01:18:33,910
<font size="64">- He usually does better than that. - I agree.</font>

3209
01:18:31,980 --> 01:18:35,550
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(He's actually a little better at games.)</font>

3210
