3304
01:21:07,300 --> 01:21:08,840
<font size="64">Han Ji Eun and the grand dukes' choice...</font>

3305
01:21:08,840 --> 01:21:10,640
<font size="64">- We'll be discreet. - Okay.</font>

3306
01:21:10,640 --> 01:21:12,040
<font size="64">- SAN will tell you. - SAN.</font>

3307
