3309
01:21:15,980 --> 01:21:18,680
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Show-offs who strut around with SAN at their side)</font>

3310
01:21:16,780 --> 01:21:18,250
<font size="64">- They're such an eyesore. - This is ridiculous.</font>

3311
01:21:18,250 --> 01:21:19,650
<font size="64">- I can't believe them. - Seriously.</font>

3312
01:21:19,650 --> 01:21:20,980
<font size="64">- Who do they think they are? - You know,</font>

3313
01:21:20,980 --> 01:21:23,020
<font size="64">- they have vastly different looks. - Seriously.</font>

3314
01:21:23,180 --> 01:21:24,250
<font size="64">Jong Kook.</font>

3315
01:21:24,250 --> 01:21:26,520
<font size="64">- I can't believe them. - Seriously.</font>

3316
01:21:25,750 --> 01:21:29,120
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The grand dukes with varying looks choose Jong Kook.)</font>

3317
01:21:26,520 --> 01:21:28,190
<font size="64">- Who do they think they are? - You know...</font>

3318
01:21:28,190 --> 01:21:29,390
