3319
01:21:29,560 --> 01:21:31,560
<font size="64">- We're done. - This is ridiculous.</font>

3320
01:21:30,290 --> 01:21:34,390
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Is Jong Kook an outsider?)</font>

