01:35:58,290 --> 01:36:00,130
<font size="64">You got rid of the balloons so fast.</font>

3900
01:36:00,130 --> 01:36:01,960
<font size="64">- You cleaned them up together? - That was really fast.</font>

3901
01:36:00,230 --> 01:36:01,790
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Truly happy)</font>

3902
01:36:01,960 --> 01:36:03,560
<font size="64">- I have a question. - Okay.</font>

3903
01:36:03,560 --> 01:36:05,330
<font size="64">So, where are you guys going for your honeymoon?</font>

3904
01:36:05,330 --> 01:36:06,800
<font size="64">- Have you decided on a place? - Have you?</font>

3905
01:36:06,800 --> 01:36:08,300
<font size="64">I'd love to get some recommendations.</font>

3906
01:36:08,800 --> 01:36:10,300
<font size="64">- Southern France. - Southern France?</font>

3907
01:36:10,300 --> 01:36:12,400
<font size="64">- It's really nice. - How much time can you take off?</font>

3908
01:36:12,400 --> 01:36:14,040
<font size="64">- Will you clear my schedule? - Sure.</font>

3909
01:36:12,670 --> 01:36:14,410
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(To the director)</font>

3910
01:36:14,510 --> 01:36:16,340
<font size="64">- A week? - We can just go with you.</font>

3911
01:36:16,340 --> 01:36:17,580
<font size="64">- A week is too short. - That would be nice.</font>

3912
01:36:17,580 --> 01:36:19,250
<font size="64">- Stop joking around. - I'd like to go with you.</font>

3913
01:36:19,250 --> 01:36:20,310
<font size="64">- Are you serious? - Yes.</font>

3914
01:36:19,750 --> 01:36:21,510
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Taking the idea right away)</font>

3915
01:36:20,310 --> 01:36:21,510
<font size="64">- We're really going. - We are really going with you.</font>

3916
01:36:21,510 --> 01:36:24,520
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Hyenas pouncing at the first chance)</font>

3917
01:36:21,510 --> 01:36:23,980
<font size="64">- Can we really do that? - We're coming with you.</font>

3918
01:36:23,980 --> 01:36:25,450
<font size="64">- Ye Eun, we're coming. - We're serious.</font>

3919
01:36:25,450 --> 01:36:27,390
<font size="64">- Then you can take two weeks off. - Really?</font>

3920
01:36:27,390 --> 01:36:28,590
<font size="64">- If you let us tag along. - Of course.</font>

3921
01:36:28,590 --> 01:36:29,860
<font size="64">- We can shoot there. - If you let us come.</font>

3922
01:36:29,860 --> 01:36:31,320
<font size="64">Then you should come. Really.</font>

3923
01:36:31,320 --> 01:36:32,830
<font size="64">You guys can just come with us,</font>

3924
01:36:32,830 --> 01:36:35,190
<font size="64">hang out with us for a bit, and then leave.</font>

3925
01:36:35,190 --> 01:36:36,660
<font size="64">- I did the same thing. - At Gimpo Airport...</font>

3926
01:36:35,730 --> 01:36:37,530
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(During the "Infinite Challenge" period)</font>

3927
01:36:36,660 --> 01:36:37,730
<font size="64">I mean, we can part ways at Incheon International Airport.</font>

3928
01:36:37,730 --> 01:36:39,730
<font size="64">- We can shoot 2 episodes there. - Right, 2 episodes.</font>

3929
01:36:39,730 --> 01:36:41,970
<font size="64">- Then we will let you go. - After shooting two episodes?</font>

3930
01:36:39,830 --> 01:36:44,570
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(The honeymoon race is taking shape.)</font>

3931
01:36:41,970 --> 01:36:43,770
<font size="64">- I'm totally in. - That sounds great.</font>

3932
01:36:43,770 --> 01:36:45,400
<font size="64">So we will be shooting for about two days.</font>

3933
01:36:45,400 --> 01:36:47,940
<font size="64">But I'm pretty sure that by the second day,</font>

3934
01:36:47,940 --> 01:36:49,140
<font size="64">Ye Eun will be crying by herself.</font>

3935
01:36:50,510 --> 01:36:52,680
<font size="64">"Why are you crying? What's wrong?"</font>

3936
01:36:50,910 --> 01:36:55,050
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(She's going to cry due to the shattered honeymoon fantasies.)</font>

3937
01:36:52,710 --> 01:36:55,450
<font size="64">- "Please stop it." - "It's nothing."</font>

3938
01:36:56,050 --> 01:36:57,980
<font size="64">- And she will be blushing. - "I'm the bride here."</font>

3939
01:36:58,120 --> 01:36:59,390
<font size="64">This is really nice.</font>

3940
01:36:59,390 --> 01:37:00,650
<font size="64">- It really is. - Congratulations.</font>

3941
01:37:00,650 --> 01:37:02,790
<font size="64">- Congratulations. - Anyway, her wedding is...</font>

3942
01:37:02,790 --> 01:37:04,390
<font size="64">- in December. - Right.</font>

3943
01:37:03,220 --> 01:37:06,360
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Congratulations on becoming a December bride.)</font>

3944
01:37:04,390 --> 01:37:06,930
<font size="64">I hope you prepare well for the wedding until then.</font>

3945
01:37:06,930 --> 01:37:07,960
<font size="64">We wish you a beautiful life together.</font>

3946
01:37:07,790 --> 01:37:11,830
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Bride-to-be Ye Eun is going to work even harder.)</font>

3947
01:37:07,960 --> 01:37:09,830
<font size="64">- Congratulations! - Congratulations!</font>

3948
01:37:09,830 --> 01:37:12,200
<font size="64">- Congratulations. - I'm so happy for you.</font>

3949
01:37:12,200 --> 01:37:13,330
<font size="64">- When the wedding gets closer... - All right.</font>

3950
01:37:13,330 --> 01:37:14,530
<font size="64">Shall we get going now?</font>

3951
01:37:13,400 --> 01:37:14,870
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Cut!)</font>

3952
01:37:15,300 --> 01:37:16,900
<font size="64">- Take the cake with you. - Oh, the cake.</font>

3953
01:37:15,770 --> 01:37:18,200
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(Episodes on September 20 and September 27...)</font>

3954
01:37:17,170 --> 01:37:18,870
<font size="64">- Let's eat it together. - Let's eat.</font>

3955
01:37:18,200 --> 01:37:21,470
<font size="64" color="#ffffcc">(won't air due to the Asian sports event.)</font>

3956
01:37:18,870 --> 01:37:20,010
<font size="64">- Let's share it. - Go ahead and eat.</font>

3957
01:37:20,010 --> 01:37:21,340
<font size="64">- Let's eat it after lunch. - Let's do that.</font>

3958
01:37:21,340 --> 01:37:23,780
<font size="64">- After lunch. - Let's eat it after the meal.</font>

3959
01:37:23,780 --> 01:37:25,240
<font size="64">All right. Pack it away.</font>

3960
